~ first_dialogue
???: Hey idiot.
Roadie: ... Me?
??: No someone else
??: Yea you!
????: Shut up both of you! Jeez
Roadie: Who are you?
Harry: I'm Harry. Just a dude that was getting dinner tonight before all this went down.
Angel: C'mon Harry, tell the truth
Devil: Yea, keep lying to him dude
Roadie: Who are they?
Harry: Annoying and Annoying Two
Angel: Honored
Devil: *Blows Raspberry*
Harry: I have had these two on my shoulders my entire life. Can't remember a time without them
Harry: My moral compass made manifest, even if they are like children
Angel: I am much older than you young man
Devil: Yea, granny over there is like, older than recorded history
Angel: Older than two minutes unlike you, you pajama-clad manchild
Devil: Don't pretend like you don't love it~
Roadie: Are they always like this?
Harry: Yea
Roadie: Well i'm the detective on this case, i'll come back for questions real soon. Don't go anywhere
Harry: I'll be around
Angel: Ta-ta~
Devil: Come back real soon~
Roadie: ugh...
=> END

